  "details": "Yesterday my friends told me my tails are on the weird position on their view(global only) after I toggled the Raycast off due to the world collider, after some tests, it seems like due to the issue of the sync timing(or so), when I toggled the component it was snapped to higher position than what I saw in the local.\n\nI always think the transform will back to the stats when the transform is no longer controlled by the Raycast component, but guess I was wrong. Anyway, I think it will be much convenience if there's a toggle like the Physbones which will reset things back to the original stats",
